      "decision": "Design approved at the Step 3a briefing, with one change: D4's gap is closed, not accepted",
      "why": "User asked why ListEntriesByVehicleBetween could not be logged from the caller. The call site in analytics is nightly-and-post-write only, never a page render, so it can.",
